{"script":"sj_037_01","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]吾观之，说是“细微之处见禅心”可也。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]禅是超脱之法，却不是弃世之意，不是一定要在高堂广殿之中才能参悟，在俗世红尘之中也能处处得见禅机。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]禅是由静入道之途，此静非是音静、非是风雨静、非是十方俱静，是心静。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]这处营地虽然处处因陋就简，但每一处都显露无穷生趣，是因为建造者建造之时，并不是单纯地完成任务，而是在经营生活。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]在这个深渊之中，这样一座营地，毫无疑问是一处难得一见的心安之所。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]安心即禅心，可见施主也是心中有禅。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]唔……这么一说，施主你可有想过要入我门来吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]嗯？你说你要钻研工匠技艺，无心他顾？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]哈哈哈！甚是可惜！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]不过，禅心道法自然，不争一时。以后若有机会，再一道论禅也不迟。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"剋-对我们的营地感觉如何？"}